      "text": "The length of the credit history has a moderate effect, with risk decreasing as the history gets longer."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The effect of delinquencies on default risk grows with credit utilization."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Recent credit inquiries, number of dependents, months at the current address, and age hardly matter to the model's predictions."
    }
  ]
